"The Hub 01 Fire Support Platform, or just the FSP.  Like the Hybrid Weapons "
"Platform, it combines black-finished aluminum, blue polymer furniture, and a "
"number of proprietary bolts and fasteners for a sci-fi aesthetic.  The barrel"
" is stamped with \"40x46mm LV\", and the magwell looks like it accepts some "
"truly MASSIVE magazines, which the gun appears to be capable of emptying in "
"semi-automatic or fully-automatic fashion."
msgstr ""

