msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description of gun "12-gauge Gatling gun"
#. ~ Description of "12-gauge Gatling gun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"An electrically driven six barrel Gatling shotgun, fed from handmade cloth "
"belts.  Even properly mounted, this seems like an unwieldy beast, and the six"
" separate barrels make for difficult zeroing.  The externally driven action "
"means this is much less likely to jam."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
