#. ~ Description of "4-round semi-auto fowling shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"This is a 4 round semi-automatic shotgun, with the ability to automatically "
"cycle birdshot as well.  Not like birdshot will do you much good against the "
"undead."
msgstr ""

