#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"This Remington 870 Modular Combat System shotgun is currently set up for "
"breaching operations, with a 10 inch barrel and no stock.  It is small enough"
" to carry as a secondary weapon, specifically to pop open any pesky doors you"
" might come across.  The grip's design makes for controllable yet unpleasant "
"recoil, and the barrel lacks any sights."
msgstr ""

