#. ~ Description of gun "double-barreled shotgun"
#. ~ Description of "double-barreled shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"The classic double-barreled shotgun, with the barrels arranged side-by-side."
"  It consists of little more than 2 barrels, a striker to hit the shell, and "
"a wooden stock"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Variant name of gun "double-barreled shotgun"
#. ~ Variant name of item "double-barreled shotgun"
