#. ~ Description of gun mod "belt clip"
#. ~ Description of "belt clip"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json
msgid ""
"A belt clip that attaches to the grip or slide of a pistol to facilitate "
"'Mexican carry', the practice of carrying without a holster.  It does not "
"offer any protection for the trigger, so users are strongly advised to carry "
"with the chamber empty or select a firearm with a very heavy trigger pull."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun mod "ported barrel"
#. ~ Description of "ported barrel"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/barrel.json
msgid ""
"A ported barrel redirects exhaust gases to compensate for muzzle climb, "
"improving recoil but increasing noise and reducing accuracy slightly."
msgstr ""

