#. ~ Description of "shortened barrel"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/barrel.json
msgid ""
"A shortened barrel results in markedly reduced accuracy and a minor increase "
"in noise, but also greatly improves the ease with which the weapon can be "
"carried and wielded."
msgstr ""

